tutorial-janitor-name = Janitor

ent-TutorialHoloMentorJanitor = N.A.N.C.I.
    .desc = A holographic training intelligence. She is projected from the nearest holopad, and is very pleased you asked.

## Goal titles

tutorial-janitor-goal-closet = Custodial closet
tutorial-janitor-goal-spill = Welder fuel
tutorial-janitor-goal-trolley = Trolley service
tutorial-janitor-goal-drain = Clogged drain
tutorial-janitor-goal-soap = Loose soap
tutorial-janitor-goal-trash = Trash run
tutorial-janitor-goal-lights = Blackout
tutorial-janitor-goal-rust = Rust
tutorial-janitor-goal-graffiti = Graffiti
tutorial-janitor-goal-cleanade = Cleanade
tutorial-janitor-goal-potassium = Science spill
tutorial-janitor-goal-finale = Hall of fame

## Closet

tutorial-janitor-sg-welcome = Listen to N.A.N.C.I.
tutorial-janitor-nanci-welcome-1 = Welcome to the Nanotrasen Employee Onboarding Facility.
tutorial-janitor-nanci-welcome-2 = You have been assigned to Custodial Compliance.
tutorial-janitor-nanci-welcome-3 = This module is about fluids. None of them belong on you.

tutorial-janitor-sg-wear-galoshes = Equip the galoshes.
tutorial-janitor-control-wear-galoshes = Press [color=#FFD24A][bold][keybind="ActivateItemInHand"][/bold][/color] to wear the galoshes, or remove your shoes, and put the galoshes in the feet slot.
tutorial-janitor-nanci-wear-galoshes-1 = Open the custodial locker.
tutorial-janitor-nanci-wear-galoshes-2 = Put the galoshes on, and leave the rest of the locker alone.
tutorial-janitor-nanci-wear-galoshes-3 = You are now immune to a wet floor. That will matter shortly.
tutorial-janitor-nanci-wear-galoshes-4 = Applicant four tested the wet floor without them.
tutorial-janitor-nanci-wear-galoshes-nofeet-1 = You do not have feet.
tutorial-janitor-nanci-wear-galoshes-nofeet-2 = The galoshes have been informed, and they are staying in the locker.
tutorial-janitor-nanci-wear-galoshes-nofeet-3 = A wet floor is a hazard for applicants who can fall on one.
tutorial-janitor-nanci-slip-galoshes = The galoshes work best when they are on your feet.

## Spill

tutorial-janitor-sg-dip-mop = Wet the mop.
tutorial-janitor-control-dip-mop = Click the janitorial trolley while holding the mop.
tutorial-janitor-nanci-dip-mop-1 = A passenger spilled welder fuel in the hall.
tutorial-janitor-nanci-dip-mop-2 = Wet the mop in the trolley. A dry mop is a stick.

tutorial-janitor-sg-clear-one = Mop one puddle.
tutorial-janitor-control-clear-one = Click a fuel puddle with a mop.
tutorial-janitor-nanci-clear-one-1 = Click a fuel puddle with a mop.

tutorial-janitor-sg-wring-tip = Listen to N.A.N.C.I.
tutorial-janitor-nanci-wring-tip-1 = The mop is dirty now.
tutorial-janitor-nanci-wring-tip-2 = When it gives up, use it on the trolley to wring it out.

tutorial-janitor-sg-clear-rest = Mop the rest of the hall.
tutorial-janitor-control-clear-rest = Click each remaining fuel puddle with the mop.
tutorial-janitor-nanci-clear-rest-1 = Mop the rest of this hall.
tutorial-janitor-nanci-clear-rest-2 = The floor is no longer a fire hazard.

## Trolley

tutorial-janitor-sg-pull-cart = Pull the trolley in.
tutorial-janitor-control-pull-cart = Press [color=#FFD24A][bold][keybind="TryPullObject"][/bold][/color] on the trolley to drag it.
tutorial-janitor-nanci-pull-cart-1 = Bring the trolley with you.

tutorial-janitor-sg-empty-cart = Empty the dirty water.
tutorial-janitor-control-empty-cart = Drag the trolley onto the floor drain, or right click the trolley and use spill liquid.
tutorial-janitor-nanci-empty-cart-1 = That water is a sample of everything you just cleaned.
tutorial-janitor-nanci-empty-cart-2 = Empty the tank onto the floor drain.

tutorial-janitor-sg-refill-cart = Refill the trolley.
tutorial-janitor-control-refill-cart = Use the bucket on the water tank, then on the trolley to fill it.
tutorial-janitor-nanci-refill-cart-1 = Fill the bucket from the water tank, then pour it into the trolley.
tutorial-janitor-nanci-refill-cart-2 = A biohazard cleanup starts with water that is only water.

tutorial-janitor-sg-insert-mop = Put the mop in the trolley.
tutorial-janitor-control-insert-mop = Hold the mop and press [color=#FFD24A][bold][keybind="AltActivateItemInWorld"][/bold][/color] on the trolley.
tutorial-janitor-nanci-insert-mop-1 = The trolley has a place for the mop.
tutorial-janitor-nanci-insert-mop-2 = Put the mop in the trolley.

tutorial-janitor-sg-remove-mop = Take the mop out of the trolley.
tutorial-janitor-control-remove-mop = Press [color=#FFD24A][bold][keybind="AltActivateItemInWorld"][/bold][/color] on the trolley to take the mop out.
tutorial-janitor-nanci-remove-mop-1 = Take the mop back out.
tutorial-janitor-nanci-remove-mop-2 = It stays on the trolley until a floor needs it.

## Drain

tutorial-janitor-sg-plunge = Unclog the drain.
tutorial-janitor-control-plunge = Click the drain with the plunger. It can take more than one try.
tutorial-janitor-nanci-plunge-1 = This drain is clogged, so the mop is on break.
tutorial-janitor-nanci-plunge-2 = Use the plunger, and pump again if it does not catch.

## Soap

tutorial-janitor-sg-step-soap = Walk over the soap.
tutorial-janitor-control-step-soap = Use [color=#FFD24A][bold][keybind="MoveUp"][/bold][/color] [color=#FFD24A][bold][keybind="MoveLeft"][/bold][/color] [color=#FFD24A][bold][keybind="MoveDown"][/bold][/color] [color=#FFD24A][bold][keybind="MoveRight"][/bold][/color] to walk over the soap.
tutorial-janitor-nanci-step-soap-1 = Walk over the soap in the hall.

tutorial-janitor-sg-watch-slip = Watch the assistant slip.
tutorial-janitor-control-watch-slip = Wait for the assistant to hit the soap.
tutorial-janitor-nanci-watch-slip-1 = Watch the assistant.
tutorial-janitor-nanci-watch-slip-2 = The galoshes were for you. The soap is for everyone else.
tutorial-janitor-nanci-watch-slip-nofeet = You have no feet to slip on, so the soap is for everyone else.

tutorial-janitor-sg-pickup-soap = Pick up the soap.
tutorial-janitor-control-pickup-soap = Click the soap to pick it up.
tutorial-janitor-nanci-pickup-soap-1 = Pick the soap up and put it away.
tutorial-janitor-nanci-pickup-soap-2 = A janitor who leaves soap out is a slipping hazard with a job title.

## Trash

tutorial-janitor-sg-arm-bag = Activate the trash bag.
tutorial-janitor-control-arm-bag = Press [color=#FFD24A][bold][keybind="ActivateItemInHand"][/bold][/color] to use the trash bag.
tutorial-janitor-nanci-arm-bag-1 = Take the trash bag and activate it.

tutorial-janitor-sg-fill-bag = Bag most of the litter.
tutorial-janitor-control-fill-bag = Click the litter while holding the bag.
tutorial-janitor-nanci-fill-bag-1 = Use the bag on the litter. It does the sweeping.
tutorial-janitor-nanci-fill-bag-2 = Most of the pile will do.

tutorial-janitor-sg-flush = Flush the disposal.
tutorial-janitor-control-flush = Press [color=#FFD24A][bold][keybind="AltActivateItemInWorld"][/bold][/color] on the disposal to dump the bag, then flush it.
tutorial-janitor-nanci-flush-1 = Dump the bag into the disposal and flush it.
tutorial-janitor-nanci-flush-2 = That sound is the trash becoming Cargo's problem.

## Lights

tutorial-janitor-sg-take-replacer = Take the light replacer.
tutorial-janitor-control-take-replacer = Click the light replacer to pick it up.
tutorial-janitor-nanci-take-replacer-1 = The bulbs are shattered, and the power is fine.
tutorial-janitor-nanci-take-replacer-2 = Take the light replacer.

tutorial-janitor-sg-take-tubes = Take the light tubes.
tutorial-janitor-control-take-tubes = Click the box of light tubes.
tutorial-janitor-nanci-take-tubes-1 = Take the box of light tubes as well.

tutorial-janitor-sg-load-replacer = Load the light replacer.
tutorial-janitor-control-load-replacer = Click the light replacer with the box of tubes.
tutorial-janitor-nanci-load-replacer-1 = Put the tubes into the light replacer.

tutorial-janitor-sg-fix-first = Replace one bulb.
tutorial-janitor-control-fix-first = Click a dark light fixture with the loaded replacer.
tutorial-janitor-nanci-fix-first-1 = Use the replacer on a dark fixture.

tutorial-janitor-sg-fix-second = Replace the other bulb.
tutorial-janitor-control-fix-second = Click the other dark fixture with the replacer.
tutorial-janitor-nanci-fix-second-1 = Fix the fixture on the opposite wall.
tutorial-janitor-nanci-fix-second-2 = The department can see the mess again.

## Rust

tutorial-janitor-sg-take-brush = Take the wire brush.
tutorial-janitor-control-take-brush = Click the wire brush to pick it up.
tutorial-janitor-nanci-take-brush-1 = The walls have rusted, and a mop will not be consulted.
tutorial-janitor-nanci-take-brush-2 = Take the wire brush.

tutorial-janitor-sg-scrub-one = Scrub one rusted panel.
tutorial-janitor-control-scrub-one = Click a rusted wall with the wire brush and wait.
tutorial-janitor-nanci-scrub-one-1 = Scrub one rusted panel, and give it a few seconds.

tutorial-janitor-sg-scrub-rest = Scrub the remaining rust.
tutorial-janitor-control-scrub-rest = Click the other rusted panels with the wire brush.
tutorial-janitor-nanci-scrub-rest-1 = Scrub the rest of the rust.
tutorial-janitor-nanci-scrub-rest-2 = That shine is the wall agreeing to stay a wall.

## Graffiti

tutorial-janitor-sg-take-spray = Take the space cleaner.
tutorial-janitor-control-take-spray = Click the space cleaner to pick it up.
tutorial-janitor-nanci-take-spray-1 = A mop turns paint into a larger paint.
tutorial-janitor-nanci-take-spray-2 = Take the space cleaner.

tutorial-janitor-sg-spray-one = Spray one tag.
tutorial-janitor-control-spray-one = Click a graffiti tag with the space cleaner.
tutorial-janitor-nanci-spray-one-1 = Spray one tag, and do not spend the bottle on bare floor.

tutorial-janitor-sg-spray-rest = Clean the remaining tags.
tutorial-janitor-control-spray-rest = Click the remaining graffiti with the space cleaner.
tutorial-janitor-nanci-spray-rest-1 = Clean the remaining tags.
tutorial-janitor-nanci-spray-rest-2 = The lounge is presentable, which will last until the clown arrives.

## Cleanade

tutorial-janitor-sg-take-cleanade = Take a cleanade.
tutorial-janitor-control-take-cleanade = Open the crate and click a cleanade.
tutorial-janitor-nanci-take-cleanade-1 = This mess is larger than a mop's ambitions.
tutorial-janitor-nanci-take-cleanade-2 = Take a cleanade from the crate.

tutorial-janitor-sg-prime-cleanade = Prime the cleanade.
tutorial-janitor-control-prime-cleanade = Press [color=#FFD24A][bold][keybind="ActivateItemInHand"][/bold][/color] to pull the pin.
tutorial-janitor-nanci-prime-cleanade-1 = Activate the cleanade in your hand to pull the pin.

tutorial-janitor-sg-throw-cleanade = Throw the cleanade.
tutorial-janitor-control-throw-cleanade = Press [color=#FFD24A][bold][keybind="ThrowItemInHand"][/bold][/color] to throw it into the room, then step back.
tutorial-janitor-nanci-throw-cleanade-1 = Throw it into the middle of the room, and then be elsewhere.

tutorial-janitor-sg-mop-corners = Mop anything the foam missed.
tutorial-janitor-control-mop-corners = Click any leftover puddle with the mop.
tutorial-janitor-nanci-mop-corners-1 = Mop whatever the foam declined.
tutorial-janitor-nanci-mop-corners-2 = That was twenty minutes of mopping, delivered all at once.

## Potassium

tutorial-janitor-sg-mop-potassium = Mop the white spill.
tutorial-janitor-control-mop-potassium = Click the white puddle with the wet mop.
tutorial-janitor-nanci-mop-potassium-1 = There is one more spill, in Science. Mop it.
tutorial-janitor-nanci-mop-potassium-2 = Boom.
tutorial-janitor-nanci-mop-potassium-3 = Welcome to Science.

tutorial-janitor-sg-lecture = Listen to N.A.N.C.I.
tutorial-janitor-nanci-lecture-1 = That puddle was potassium.
tutorial-janitor-nanci-lecture-2 = Water on potassium is an explosion.
tutorial-janitor-nanci-lecture-3 = You were holding the water.
tutorial-janitor-nanci-lecture-4 = I kept the dose small enough to stand up from.
tutorial-janitor-nanci-lecture-5 = On a station, that dose is not small, and the blast still opened the door.

tutorial-janitor-sg-spray-potassium = Spray the potassium with space cleaner.
tutorial-janitor-control-spray-potassium = Click the white puddle with the space cleaner.
tutorial-janitor-nanci-spray-potassium-1 = The spill is back.
tutorial-janitor-nanci-spray-potassium-2 = Space cleaner does not explode on potassium.
tutorial-janitor-nanci-spray-potassium-3 = Spray the spill.
tutorial-janitor-nanci-spray-potassium-4 = The potassium is water now.

## Finale

tutorial-janitor-sg-fanfare = Listen to N.A.N.C.I.
tutorial-janitor-nanci-fanfare-1 = That concludes Custodial Compliance.
tutorial-janitor-nanci-fanfare-2 = You mopped, plunged, scrubbed, and survived Science.

tutorial-janitor-sg-wear-suit = Wear the purple jumpsuit.
tutorial-janitor-control-wear-suit = Press [color=#FFD24A][bold][keybind="ActivateItemInHand"][/bold][/color] to wear the jumpsuit.
tutorial-janitor-nanci-wear-suit-1 = Take the purple jumpsuit from the pedestal and put it on.
tutorial-janitor-nanci-wear-suit-2 = Assistants do not get this jumpsuit.

tutorial-janitor-sg-cryo-tip = Leave through the cryopod when you are ready.
tutorial-janitor-nanci-cryo-tip-1 = There is cake, and there are no more tests.
tutorial-janitor-nanci-cryo-tip-2 = The cake is not a test. We checked.
tutorial-janitor-nanci-cryo-tip-3 = Step into the cryopod when you want a real station.
tutorial-janitor-nanci-cryo-tip-4 = I will be watching from every holopad on the station.
